{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1111361922"}, "name":{"label":"Zee Islam"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-18T05:39:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"13647744905"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent app"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app! It offers lots of customisability and integrates with Apple devices really well. Well worth the money. \n\nSome features I would suggest: \n- The star icon on the bottom right leads you to a statistics screen. These stats are great, but I personally would also love to see a heatmap of the whole year for my tasks. The app already lets you see a monthly heatmap for your tasks (e.g. an overview of what days you completed/skipped in December), but I’d love to also see a yearly version of this on the statistics screen. \n- There is feature where you can share your stats in a PNG image, which includes the app icon. This is very trivial, but this app icon doesn’t update if the user has set a custom icon for the app. If you could make the icon in this image match whatever the user has set, that would make it consistent.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
