{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id27106909"}, "name":{"label":"ElBaroni"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-08T18:59:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"10800813907"}, "title":{"label":"A brilliant app"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this today to assist with staying motivated on healthy eating, booze-free days, and so on. It’s incredibly intuitive, beautifully designed, and does everything I’ve wanted it to do. Highly recommended.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id340755006"}, "name":{"label":"BuckBuckingham"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-19T12:49:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.13"}, "id":{"label":"10719343015"}, "title":{"label":"A year on streaks"}, "content":{"label":"This week marks a year on Streaks. I’m not addicted, I’m committed.  Streaks has helped me focus my intentions into completions.\n\nI would consider myself a creative, active person but somewhat scattered in my approach to personal growth. It’s very easy to let “other’’ things get in the way of what you want to do.\n\nI used to draw most days, which is a lot. NOW I draw everyday. In manageable and achievable goals. My level of drawing has jumped another level because of my commitment to grow. Streaks has most certainly done that.  \n\nThis year I have drawn on 1300 plus occasions, practised piano five times a week, written a screen play, a graphic novel and a stage play.  \n\nStreaks has allowed me to focus on what I love to do. It is the most powerful tool I use.\n\nThank you Streaks team.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id337521195"}, "name":{"label":"Snazzle600"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-03T19:23:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.11"}, "id":{"label":"10655113870"}, "title":{"label":"Streaks is the best thing ever!"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app so much, really great at keeping me accountable to my habits and daily tasks. I have one page for health (drink water, stretching, vitamins, exercising), one for hobbies (e.g. learning language 10 mins 3 times a week) and one for work tasks. The once off purchase is also amazing, so many apps hit you with expensive subscriptions. I would recommend this to anyone trying to get a better hold over their life and accomplish the important things that matter to them. I also love that it’s customisable. Now I don’t have to think about all the things I need to do. I just open up streaks throughout the day and it has it all there for me. Great option for managing ADHD. I never write reviews but I had to for this because it’s so good.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id176161238"}, "name":{"label":"JillMangos"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-22T03:52:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"10612229613"}, "title":{"label":"I’ve used it every day for over three years"}, "content":{"label":"I originally got Streaks to improve my water drinking habits. I’ve now tracked and changed dozens of behaviours. \nSimple to use and flexible for whatever you want.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id102070600"}, "name":{"label":"NOYB2025-01"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-18T18:40:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.4.7"}, "id":{"label":"10600473428"}, "title":{"label":"Room for improvement"}, "content":{"label":"The Streaks app is very simplistic and rudimental causing Tasks to be mixed in an aggregated form. This adversely effects organisation of Tasks and and their respective sub-Tasks. Improvement can be implemented as follows: 1. Streaks to be segregated into subfolders (eg. Exercise -> type of exercise category such as cardiovascular, resistance, etc, and then within those subfolders the relevant exercise program). 2. The Tasks being listed not by chronological creation but by their alpha-numeric order. - Note that you can reorder (Sort Tasks) by “Tap settings” -> “Long press and drag”.\n\n Tasks. 3. When creating a Task, the creation of an additional Task by default saves the newly created Task to that of the previous Tasks location. If that Task is to be the start of a new dataset, the user can then specify the relevant Task for which it is to be saved and the process continues accordingly. - I will add to this review if I utilise the app more rather than migrating to another one and if there is other functionality that I believe needs implementing for the app to be fit-for-purpose.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
