{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id298194987"}, "name":{"label":"SalemCade"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-01T08:28:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"9.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"9775572407"}, "title":{"label":"Game Changer"}, "content":{"label":"Came here to write a review mainly to say THANK YOU to the app developers. \nThis app is a game changer. I was struggling to sleep one night, and wondering if there was some possible way to be more motivated and consistent with every day goals and habits I want to form. Well lucky for me, and for you when you get this app into your life, there is. Tbh I was looking for something that managed to keep me motivated in a playful way, similar to how DuoLingo does, and incredibly, here it is. This app has changed my life for the better. Actually. \nCannot recommend enough.\nThe sleek graphics, simple bold colours, and intuitive user interface are all big winners. \nIt’s extremely ADHD/neurodivergent friendly as well. \nThanks so much guys - you’ve done amazing work", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
